      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<div style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\n<div style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">According to the question, arraged in alphabetical order → D E N S T T U</div>\n\n<div style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> </div>\n\n<div style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\n<p data-end=\"591\" data-start=\"570\">Thus, the number of letters between the letter that is second from the left and the one that is fourth from the right in the new letter-cluster formed → (S)<span class=\"mord\">19 </span><span class=\"mbin\">− (E)</span><span class=\"mord\">5 </span><span class=\"mbin\">− </span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mrel\">= </span>13</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
